#: package/contents/ui/config.qml:327
msgid ""
"Tip: Switch virtual desktops (Meta+F1 / Meta+F2 or the pager) to see the "
"wallpaper change. You can also drag an image onto the desktop to set the "
"wallpaper for the current desktop."
msgstr ""
"提示：切换虚拟桌面（Meta+F1 / Meta+F2 或分页器）即可看到壁纸变化。也可以把图"
"片拖到桌面上，为当前桌面设置壁纸。"

